# _docs/ai/verify/checks.env - the deterministic checks this project declares.
# scripts/check.sh <NAME> runs one quietly (full log to _docs/ai/logs/, summary to stdout, the evidence
# file and checks-state.json); scripts/verify-gate.sh --run runs them all. A task group with no FAIL
# row (a completion claim) passes the gate only when every check declared here is PASS at HEAD.
# Declare nothing (every line commented) and nothing is required. Keep each command the one the
# manual's Project table names; a slow full suite can stay here while the worker runs targeted tests
# directly - the gate needs the whole set green once per close, not per edit.
# Optional: BOOT_PROBE=<url that must answer 2xx/3xx>; DEPENDENCY_CHECK=<command>.
TEST="dotnet test"
BUILD="dotnet build --no-restore"
LINT="dotnet format --verify-no-changes"
DEPENDENCY_CHECK="dotnet list package --vulnerable"
#BOOT_PROBE="http://localhost:5000/health"
